{'symbol': 'PAYX', 'date': '2022-09-15 12:00:00', 'title': 'PAYCHEX NAMED A LEADER IN PAYROLL SERVICES BY NELSONHALL', 'text': 'THIS IS THE SIXTH CONSECUTIVE TIME THAT PAYCHEX HAS BEEN RECOGNIZED AS AN INDUSTRY LEADER ROCHESTER, N.Y. , SEPT. 15, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0NELSONHALL, A GLOBAL ANALYST AND RESEARCH FIRM, HAS ONCE AGAIN IDENTIFIED PAYCHEX, INC., A LEADING PROVIDER OF INTEGRATED HUMAN CAPITAL MANAGEMENT SOFTWARE SOLUTIONS FOR HUMAN RESOURCES, PAYROLL, BENEFITS, AND INSURANCE SERVICES,\xa0AS A "LEADER" IN ITS 2022 NELSONHALL VENDOR EVALUATION AND ASSESSMENT TOOL (NEAT) REPORT FOR PAYROLL SERVICE PROVIDERS.'}